{"id":895,"imdb":"tt0060107","en":"Andrei Rublev","orig":"Андрей Рублёв","ar":"أندريه روبليف","tag":"In much wisdom there is much grief.","ov":"دراما روسية واسعة النطاق ، يركز هذا الفيلم على حياة رسام الأيقونات الدينية الموقر أندريه روبليف. ينجرف الراهب الساعي إلى السلام من مكان إلى آخر في عصر مضطرب ، ويكتسب في النهاية شهرة في فنه. ولكن بعد أن شهد روبليف معركة وحشية وتورطه عن غير قصد ، أخذ يتعهد بالصمت ويقضي بعض الوقت بعيدًا عن عمله. عندما يبدأ في تخفيف روحه المضطربة ، يتخذ خطوات نحو أن يصبح رسامًا مرة أخرى.","rd":"1966-12-16","rt":183,"g":[18,36],"lang":"ru","budget":1300000,"revenue":24173,"companies":[{"n":"Mosfilm","logo":"/xenuUvcunUNpbaDOYGhWZERaym7.png","c":"SU"}],"countries":["SU"],"langs":["Tatar","Russian","Italian"],"col":null,"rel":[{"c":"SU","d":"1966-12-16"},{"c":"FR","d":"1969-05-18"},{"c":"GB","d":"1973-08-13"},{"c":"US","d":"1973-10-01"},{"c":"PT","d":"1983-01-23"},{"c":"NL","d":"1985-07-25"},{"c":"ES","d":"1990-08-13"},{"c":"DE","d":"2016-07-11"}],"dir":["Andrei Tarkovsky"],"prod":[],"wri":["Andrei Tarkovsky","Andrei Konchalovsky"],"mus":["Vyacheslav Ovchinnikov"],"dop":["Vadim Yusov"],"cast":[{"n":"Anatoliy Solonitsyn","ch":"Andrei Rublev","p":"/37Vb7vNMHAz1s2WI5kW4BHt0X0N.jpg"},{"n":"Ivan Lapikov","ch":"Kirill","p":"/wzh8pRrBOQY0YP2QzTS5QlxlVqj.jpg"},{"n":"Mykola Hrynko","ch":"Daniil Chornyy","p":"/n8lxXQbLYOed7AeowxA49yB2jyS.jpg"},{"n":"Nikolai Sergeyev","ch":"Theophanus the Greek","p":"/6GB7fEtDEQLShIyEhWIaGZTKDYE.jpg"},{"n":"Irma Raush","ch":"God's Fool","p":"/y4OrVv64rB5ffIZKuiSgCbkGDWd.jpg"},{"n":"Nikolay Burlyaev","ch":"Boriska","p":"/lVpc5KNypdHVNdJJQZk7p4eijip.jpg"},{"n":"Yuriy Nazarov","ch":"Grand Duke / Minor Duke","p":"/5kSJ2Q9fcUYD5yeGvQiw2z4tFxC.jpg"},{"n":"Yuriy Nikulin","ch":"Patrikey","p":"/sxiwVxrO5VHtdIieeQH8m14JE2k.jpg"},{"n":"Rolan Bykov","ch":"Buffoon","p":"/y5glWWySA61CeGk9kWA6CZkMG4J.jpg"},{"n":"Nikolay Grabbe","ch":"Stepan, Centurion of the Grand Duke","p":"/tU7amnjnlUxQLdnhivzh2p5ToS0.jpg"},{"n":"Mikhail Kononov","ch":"Fo